# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of the
# committer's OS or local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true convert LF -> CRLF on checkout, which
# pylint's unexpected-line-ending-format check (and potentially a CRLF
# shebang breaking a shell script inside a Linux Docker container) can catch.
* text=auto eol=lf
